# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [Unreleased]

---
## [Security & Maintenance Hardening] - 2025-10-02
- Updated project LICENSE.
- Adjusted Dockerfile to ensure logging uses the Europe/Berlin timezone.
- Performed test run (iO) to validate changes.
- Added baseline .env file for local configuration.
- Removed accidentally checked-in user/password from the offline database to prevent offline hash cracking.
- Mitigated XML-related risks by switching to defusedxml and deleting sensitive log outputs.
- Cleaned up code and improved documentation; marked/attributed authors in individual files.

---

## [Integration of VoR-functions] - 2025-09-30
- included issuer_characteristics as optional component of a VoR Request.
- integrated Flask server communication within cpc-partition (dev only!)

---

## [OMAG Demonstrator Integration] - 2025-09-03
- Updated documentation and README files to reflect recent changes and improvements.
- Enhanced verification of request and RBAC mechanisms based on discussions with Yuanchen.
- Added OMAGs certificates for testing the demonstrator.
- Improved namespace testing for Siemens S7-1500 PLC.
- Updated XML configuration files for the CPC partition.
- Split Modbus-TCP files into two separate libraries for better modularity.
- Extended `OpcUaClientManager` to support namespace aliases.
- Debugged and improved error handling for `IdentifierType String` in OPC UA threads.
- Implemented OPC UA read method via string identifier for Siemens S7-1500 use case.

---

## [Master Thesis Completion Merge] - 2025-07
- Added support for **LOGO Modbus Server** providing compatibility with LOGO PLCs.
- Configured demonstrator setup at HSEL, including S7-1200 PLC and RevPi Laser Engraving station.
- Fixed issues with **Docker Compose deployment**.
- Progressed towards **D13 demonstrator** for SIoT project (IEEE conference).
- Improved documentation and code readability with updated code comments.

---

## [Flask Server Bridge, CPC-to-OPCUA Mapping & Acceptance Verification] - 2025-05
- **Flask Server Integration**
  - Added `flask-server-bridge` with modular lifecycle control.
  - Enabled threaded operation (pending full validation).
- **Acceptance Verification**
  - Added CPC value verification logic against acceptance criteria.
  - Initial CPC-to-OPCUA runtime value mapping.
- **Database Enhancements**
  - SQL query updates to improve sorting by priority/timestamp.
  - Introduced `mapped_requests.db` for intermediate storage.
- **Code Refactoring**
  - Split `VoR_2` functions into libraries for readability/testing.
  - Removed legacy code and comments.
- **Testing**
  - Initial tests on Flask server bridge.
  - Acceptance verification pending full load tests.
- **Containerization**
  - New temporary VoR backend container with acceptance verification.

---

## [Threading, Authentication & Authorization Enhancements] - 2025-05
- **VoR Integration**
  - Forwarding logic updated to exclude credentials.
  - Began integration of VoR components.
- **Performance & Stability**
  - Optimized CPU usage under high load.
  - Fixed infinite recursion and callback registration bugs.
  - Thread safety fixes in SQLite operations.
- **Authentication & Authorization**
  - Introduced foundational User and Authorization Management.
  - Deprecated `UserManagerXML` in favor of scalable solution.
  - Initial tests for user and RBAC OPC UA methods.
- **Testing**
  - Integration tests via centralMO client.
  - Early systematic partition testing.
- **Refactoring**
  - Introduced variable typing & return types.
  - Moved legacy code into `legacy/` folder.
  - Cleaned up credentials handling.
- **DevOps**
  - Optimized Dockerfiles.
  - Updated README for CPC partition.
- **Artifacts**
  - Added `rbac.csv` example for testing.

---

## [Container Networking, Interface Structure & User Management] - 2025-04
- Added **Bash script** for automated container network startup and connections.
- Dynamic import of interface descriptions.
- Improved naming logic in OPC UA server interface.
- Added hierarchical structure support in interface OPC UA server.
- Integrated **Ecotec-ModbusTCP Server** as Docker container.
- Initial implementation of **user management for interface partitioning**.
- Updated request interface & OPC UA methods.
- Request authorization groundwork for VoR step 1.
- Documentation improvements including new CHANGELOG.

---

## [CPC Aggregation Service & VoR Support] - 2025-04
- Improved **Interface Server Integration**
  - Added variable injection on CPC startup/connection.
  - Improved ModbusTCP variable integration.
  - Updated SHM format with metadata support.
- **Stability & Performance**
  - Added reconnection logic for ModbusTCP (30s).
  - Warnings for SHM usage >90%.
  - Byte size measurement for SHM objects.
  - Introduced POSIX MQ for request submission.
  - Fixed starvation and semaphore issues.
- **Bug Fixes**
  - Resolved OPC UA object errors.
  - Improved XML error handling.
  - Fixed logging issues in CPC partition.
- **Code Cleanup**
  - Removed deprecated code.
  - Updated README and docs.
- **Testing**
  - Verified SHM behavior under high utilization.
  - Tested with non-responsive servers.

---
